      q: "<div class=\"stimulus\">In a ripple tank, a vibrating dipper of frequency 20 Hz produces plane waves that travel at 0.30 m/s. The waves meet a barrier with two gaps, A (width 6.0 cm) and B (width 1.0 cm), in separate parts of the tank.<svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 215\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:330px;height:auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"38\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"38\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"56\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"208\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"226\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"244\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"262\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2a62c9\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"94\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#222\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">Gap A = 6.0 cm</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">Gap B = 1.0 cm</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"normal\" fill=\"#222\">(plane waves from the left; not to scale)</text></svg></div>The dipper frequency is doubled with the wave speed unchanged. The spreading of the waves beyond gap B:",
